tps://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031437_1194437931592901_3877599479731641564_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FmJM5jqMp1oQ7kNvwFHX7Rl&_nc_oc=Adpole1MTPX5A26xexsKTP_dNslekZ2zkhqwqeomWVnfeSCFkwYSwU3hE56g22G4ObE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX5zwebTe59S9Dkoub23TvSSZ7Jso71nGiLcmkMPdZghA&oe=6B0EFF64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u4e88\u544a\u7de8\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u753b\u50cf.png", "id": "1012028274054504", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75258663_1012028277387837_7425862253591877070_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ESoK4I8TBWAQ7kNvwGvs69v&_nc_oc=Adp5XWg52OHFC4mFsBx8Au0NW9oH92_q6ZJGtuVLFjtr6_jM_RO0YNMSVU0VDhwho9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXocct5-jK31mGHIBdFHra5K9NLZ6Mo6ZNt3-ecx0y5AA&oe=6B0F21BF"}, "display_name": "SWORD BISTRO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Ingredients Fly Through the Air, and AI Cooks Them!?**\n\nAll the player has to do is slice the ingredients with a sword. \n\nIt's a super easy rhythm action game!\n\n\n**Slice Ingredients Simultaneously! Freshness Up, Meow!**\n\nIf you slice three ingredients simultaneously with perfect timing, the quality of the dish will improve.\n\n\n**Create One-of-a-Kind Dishes!**\n\nThe final dish varies each time based on the sliced ingredients, making it addictive. An image-generating AI using ChatGPT creates unique dishes.\n\n\n**Share Your Finished Dishes on Social Media!**\n\nIs the completed dish delicious-looking? Or perhaps a bit unusual and mysterious? \n\nPost it on social media and have fun with your friends and followers!\n\n**Would you like to grab a sword and enjoy fantasy cooking with cats?**\n{1216381432717385}\n{815571697349553}\n{870447028275041}", "short_description": "Slice and Dice with Ease! Create Fantasy Dishes with AI.\nSimply chop ingredients to